archai-jev test data: golden of the v2 model (Decision Index format)
====================================================================

The requests in golden.jsonl (states, instructions, options) were written by the authors of
archai-jev and are covered by the licence of this repository (Apache-2.0). No text of any dataset is
included.

The numbers (the ids of the prompts, the token ids of the option keys, the scores and the
probabilities) are outputs of the reference engine of the Decision Index kit, run on the model
nickprock/archai-jev-qwen-1.5b:

  Model  https://huggingface.co/nickprock/archai-jev-qwen-1.5b   revision 7730248dc1b411f594ec88c657d26285decb3cb9 (Apache-2.0)
  Base   https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct       revision 989aa7980e4cf806f80c7fef2b1adb7bc71aa306 (Apache-2.0)
  Kit    Decision Index, commit 9eb2dbe2a358004c8782c66e40a83ac07b953fec (MIT): the format and the
         reference scoring; none of its code is included here.

The data was transformed (reduced to the fields listed in PROVENANCE.json). No model weights and
no tokenizer files are included.
